he next room will be unlocked, where new items will be waiting for you.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/952340/extras/ae633108fb05b0d01e9b666b89e5fa69.poster.avif?t=1649269985\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/952340/extras/ae633108fb05b0d01e9b666b89e5fa69.webm?t=1649269985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/952340/extras/ae633108fb05b0d01e9b666b89e5fa69.mp4?t=1649269985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Feature:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>26 items and 13 sights are waiting for you<br></li><li>Minigame after completion of the game. <br></li><li>4 different islands<br></li><li>15 costumes with 12 colors<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/952340/extras/52fa4a4d93921a335ae69db1425723ac.poster.avif?t=1649269985\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/952340/extras/52fa4a4d93921a335ae69db1425723ac.webm?t=1649269985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/952340/extras/52fa4a4d93921a335ae69db1425723ac.mp4?t=1649269985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></li></ul>",
